TEXT 672 392 Left 2 !.meas tran Tsw TRIG V(VSWITCH) VAL=2.5 RISE=1 TD=600u TARG V(VSWITCH) VAL=2.5 RISE=2 TD=600u\n.meas tran Fsw PARAM 1/Tsw
