TEXT 784 80 Left 2 !; Average input power delivered by the source\n.meas TRAN Pin_avg AVG (-V(VIN)*I(VIN1)) FROM=4.8m TO= 5m\n \n; Average output power delivered to the 40-ohm load\n.meas TRAN Pout_avg AVG (V(VOUT)*V(VOUT)/{RL}) FROM=4.8m TO=5m\n \n; Average power loss in the converter\n.meas TRAN Ploss PARAM Pin_avg-Pout_avg\n \n; Power conversion efficiency in percentage\n.meas TRAN Efficiency PARAM 100*Pout_avg/Pin_avg
TEXT 800 -232 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Iout_avg AVG I(LOAD1) FROM =4.8m TO= 5m\n.meas TRAN Iout_pp PP I(LOAD1) FROM=4.8m TO= 5m
